@Semana07Hugo_HostAddress = http://localhost:5283
@Role = Admin

### Swagger document
GET {{Semana07Hugo_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json

### Request without the required role (expected 403)
GET {{Semana07Hugo_HostAddress}}/api/products/error-test

### Create a valid product (expected 200)
POST {{Semana07Hugo_HostAddress}}/api/products
Role: {{Role}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teclado",
  "price": 25.50,
  "description": "USB"
}

### Missing required price (expected 400)
POST {{Semana07Hugo_HostAddress}}/api/products
Role: {{Role}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mouse"
}

### Trigger global error handling (expected 500)
GET {{Semana07Hugo_HostAddress}}/api/products/error-test
Role: {{Role}}
